<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 827 million.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 827 million.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction June 10 versus June 3  SUVK :</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   186/193		337/344</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.12/3.14	     3.28/3.33</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.12/3.14	     3.28/3.33</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.10/3.12	     3.27/3.32</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   787/340		40/200</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    987/470		40/330</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 46,531 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
